(2) CANCELLATION: |Corr_N| vs sum of |individual near-resonance terms| (Mertens-like)
  AP {0..10} scale2 V=21: #near-res=0, |Corr_N|=0.4875, sum|W(j/V)-base|=2.2577  (ratio 4.6x => cancellation)
  dissociated (Sidon-ish): #near-res=88, |Corr_N|=0.1509, sum|W(j/V)-base|=0.6317  (ratio 4.2x => cancellation)

  READING: dissociated => few near-resonances => small signed |Corr_N|; AP => many, resonant.
  The ABSOLUTE bound (sum of |terms|) is >> |Corr_N| (Mertens: sum|mu| >> |M(x)|) --
  cancellation ESSENTIAL (kps-S92). arc-Fourier zeros at 7|m => Mobius/x7-collapse structure.
  CLEAN ROUTE (mac-mini c): #arcs < rho* V (both a-priori, big margin) sidesteps the cancellation.
